          "end": 1096
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "It is further submitted that two other cases are pending in Allahabad Judgeship being Case No.802 of 2021, under Section 125 Cr.P.C.\npending in the court of Principal Judge, Family Court, Allahabad and Case No. 990 of 2021, under Section 12 of the Protection of Woman From Domestic Violence Act pending in the court of Deepmala Rai vs State Of U.P. And 5 Others on 17 July, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/189835224/\n1 Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Allahabad.\nIn view of the above facts and circumstances, this application deserved to be allowed and is allowed and the Criminal Case No. 3979 of 2021 arising out of Case Crime No. 206 of 2020, under Section 498A, 323, 504, 506 IPC and 3/4 D.P. Act pending in the court of Chief Judicial Magistrate, Ballia is transferred to the competent court of Allahabad judgeship.",
